<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Phantomojo — Michael Irungu Muriithi</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --abyss: #010205;
    --abyss-mid: #07090f;
    --abyss-surface: #0d1017;
    --abyss-raised: #111520;
    --abyss-border: #1a2035;
    --gold: #DB9202;
    --gold-hi: #FBBF24;
    --gold-dim: #8a5c02;
    --gold-glow: rgba(219,146,2,0.12);
    --parchment: #EFE8AB;
    --white: #f0ece0;
    --muted: #6b7190;
    --mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    --serif: 'Cinzel', serif;
    --sans: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--abyss);
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  ::selection { background: var(--gold); color: var(--abyss); }

  /* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 3px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--abyss); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--gold-dim); }

  /* ── NOISE OVERLAY ── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.25rem 3rem;
    background: rgba(1,2,5,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  #hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 8rem 3rem 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-circuit {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.04;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.1s ease both;
  }

  .hero-alias {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s ease both;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.65);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.3s ease both;
  }

  .hero-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s ease both;
  }

  .tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
    color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--abyss-surface);
  }

  .tag.gold {
    border-color: var(--gold-dim);
    color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-glow);
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.5s ease both;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--abyss);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--gold-hi); transform: translateY(-1px); }

  .btn-ghost {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--gold);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--gold-dim);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold-hi); }

  .hero-scroll-hint {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    left: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    animation: fadeUp 1s 0.8s ease both;
  }

  .scroll-line {
    width: 40px;
    height: 0.5px;
    background: var(--gold-dim);
  }

  /* ── SECTION LAYOUT ── */
  section { position: relative; padding: 6rem 3rem; }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 60px;
    height: 0.5px;
    background: var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.5);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  /* ── DIVIDER ── */
  .divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 0.5px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--abyss-border), transparent);
    margin: 0 3rem;
    width: calc(100% - 6rem);
  }

  /* ── ABOUT ── */
  #about { background: var(--abyss-mid); }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.7);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .about-text p strong {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--abyss-border);
    border: 1px solid var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .stat-cell {
    background: var(--abyss-surface);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── PROJECTS ── */
  #projects { background: var(--abyss); }

  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .project-card {
    background: var(--abyss-surface);
    padding: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: background 0.3s;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .project-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 2px; height: 0;
    background: var(--gold);
    transition: height 0.4s ease;
  }

  .project-card:hover { background: var(--abyss-raised); }
  .project-card:hover::before { height: 100%; }

  .project-status {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-glow);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--gold-dim);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .project-status.contrib {
    color: #10B981;
    background: rgba(16,185,129,0.08);
    border-color: rgba(16,185,129,0.3);
  }

  .project-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.55);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .project-tech {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tech-pill {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .project-metrics {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .metric {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .metric-val {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .metric-key {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  /* ── FEATURED / GHOSTWIRE ── */
  .featured-card {
    background: var(--abyss-surface);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .featured-card::after {
    content: 'FLAGSHIP';
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .featured-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .featured-icon {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    background: var(--gold-glow);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--gold-dim);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .featured-icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }

  .featured-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .featured-sub {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.5);
  }

  .featured-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.65);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .featured-pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--abyss-border);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pillar {
    background: var(--abyss);
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  }

  .pillar-key {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .pillar-val {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.6);
  }

  /* ── SKILLS ── */
  #skills { background: var(--abyss-mid); }

  .skills-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .skill-group {
    background: var(--abyss-surface);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .skill-group-title {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .skill-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skill-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.7);
  }

  .skill-item::before {
    content: '';
    width: 4px; height: 4px;
    background: var(--gold-dim);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .skill-item.expert { color: var(--white); }
  .skill-item.expert::before { background: var(--gold); }

  /* ── TERMINAL BIO ── */
  .terminal {
    background: #080b10;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .terminal-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .t-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .t-dot.r { background: #ff5f57; }
  .t-dot.y { background: #febc2e; }
  .t-dot.g { background: #28c840; }
  .t-title { margin-left: auto; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

  .t-prompt { color: var(--gold); }
  .t-cmd { color: var(--white); }
  .t-out { color: rgba(240,236,224,0.55); }
  .t-key { color: #10B981; }
  .t-val { color: var(--parchment); }
  .t-comment { color: #3d4f6b; }

  /* ── CTF SECTION ── */
  #ctf { background: var(--abyss); }

  .ctf-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .ctf-card {
    background: var(--abyss-surface);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .ctf-event {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .ctf-meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ctf-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── CONTACT ── */
  #contact { background: var(--abyss-mid); }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .contact-link:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .contact-link:hover { background: var(--abyss-raised); }

  .link-platform {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .link-handle {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .contact-philosophy {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.55);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .contact-philosophy blockquote {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(240,236,224,0.4);
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    padding: 2rem 3rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--abyss-border);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .footer-copy {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes pulse-gold {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }

  .blink { animation: pulse-gold 2s ease-in-out infinite; }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    #hero { padding: 6rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .about-grid, .contact-grid, .ctf-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-scroll-hint { left: 1.5rem; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#hero" class="nav-logo">PHANTOMOJO</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
    <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
    <li><a href="#ctf">CTF</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <svg class="hero-circuit" viewBox="0 0 1200 800" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <line x1="0" y1="200" x2="1200" y2="200" stroke="#DB9202" stroke-width="0.5"/>
    <line x1="0" y1="600" x2="1200" y2="600" stroke="#DB9202" stroke-width="0.5"/>
    <line x1="400" y1="0" x2="400" y2="800" stroke="#DB9202" stroke-width="0.5"/>
    <line x1="900" y1="0" x2="900" y2="800" stroke="#DB9202" stroke-width="0.5"/>
    <circle cx="400" cy="200" r="4" fill="#DB9202"/>
    <circle cx="900" cy="200" r="4" fill="#DB9202"/>
    <circle cx="400" cy="600" r="4" fill="#DB9202"/>
    <circle cx="900" cy="600" r="4" fill="#DB9202"/>
    <circle cx="150" cy="200" r="2" fill="#DB9202"/>
    <circle cx="700" cy="600" r="2" fill="#DB9202"/>
    <line x1="150" y1="0" x2="150" y2="200" stroke="#DB9202" stroke-width="0.5"/>
    <line x1="700" y1="600" x2="700" y2="800" stroke="#DB9202" stroke-width="0.5"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="hero-eyebrow">
    <span class="blink">◆</span> &nbsp;Nairobi, Kenya — EAT, UTC+3
  </div>
  <h1 class="hero-name">Michael<br>Irungu<br>Muriithi</h1>
  <div class="hero-alias">Phantomojo / ngairuru</div>
  <p class="hero-desc">
    Cybersecurity researcher & Rust systems engineer building encrypted mesh infrastructure for a world that still can't decide if privacy is a right. 
    GhostWire architect. Honeypot author. GCD4F 2026 competitor.
    I rewire the shadows.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-tags">
    <span class="tag gold">Post-Quantum Cryptography</span>
    <span class="tag gold">libp2p Mesh Networks</span>
    <span class="tag gold">Rust Systems</span>
